  expeditionTitle: Lowtide / Lamplighter's Chart
  introduction: A broken approach hides the lamplighter's last chart. Restore the
    route and discover where the inland lamps lead.
  surveyObjective: Read the departure log, cross the Timber approach to the old mooring,
    then climb the Stone lookout to the chart.
  repairObjective: 'Repairs require exact materials: 5 Timber approach cells and
    3 Stone stair cells. Mine wrong tiles to recover their units.'
  returnObjective: Stand on the lookout's chart mark and press F to recover the inland
    route.
  completeObjective: 'Chart recovered: three lamps mark the ridge to Ember Reach.
    Keep building or F6 replay; resources and repairs stay.'
  initialMessage: Survey visits are session-only. F5/F9/F8 restore stockpile + tiles
    together.
  interruptedMessage: The route is damaged or has a wrong material. Restore it, then
    recover the chart again.
  missingSurveyMessage: Discover the departure log, old mooring and lookout chart
    first.
  missingRepairMessage: Restore all five Timber crossing cells and three Stone stair
    cells with their matching materials.
  alreadyActiveMessage: The chart is already recovered. Keep exploring or F6 replay.
  returnMessage: Reach the lookout chart mark on foot, then press F.
  successMessage: 'The inland route has a name: Ember Reach. Chart recovered.'
  restartMessage: New survey started. Stockpile, construction and snapshot files
    are kept.
